@host = https://localhost:7231
@email = baseline@example.test
@password = Test1234

### Register once on a fresh database (200)
POST {{host}}/api/account/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "baseline",
  "displayName": "Baseline",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Sign in (200)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/account/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Anonymous access (401)
GET {{host}}/api/smurfs?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2

### Authenticated page (200 with a Pagination header)
GET {{host}}/api/smurfs?pageNumber=1&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}


### Delete a disposable Smurf. Replace the placeholder with its identifier.
DELETE {{host}}/api/smurfs/<smurf-id>
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
